==Strategy==
Don't let that 100% seed fool you, this stage is better challenged with a high level cap (See [[The Aku Realms]] for more info). As for a strategy, you can either rush the stage without the second wave of [[Aku Gory|Gories]] and [[Chickful A|Chickful A.]] or be safe and do it slowly to destroy the base safely.

As the enemies are all Angels and Akus, there are plenty of Ubers who counter this stage really well, such as [[Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Lilin]] and [[Mighty Deth-Troy-R (Uber Rare Cat)|Diabolosa]], but those are far from necessary. A standard meatshields + midrangers + backliners approach will get the job done. [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] are recommended.

